&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #212529"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #212529"&gt;The Company capitalized the renovation
cost as leasehold improvement and the cost of furniture and appliances as fixed asset. Leasehold improvement relates to renovation and
upgrade of the leased office.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #212529"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color: #212529"&gt;The depreciation expense
was &lt;span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_c20220901__20230831_zQtPGVbdM1ec"&gt;$4,441&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_c20210901__20220831_z5ptuRbFYod6"&gt;$41,010&lt;/span&gt; for the years ended &lt;/span&gt;August 31, 2023 and 2022&lt;span style="color: #212529"&gt;, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #212529"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color: #212529"&gt;As of August 31&lt;/span&gt;,
